	(text "Firgelli F-SD-H-450-12V actuator. Max 5.5A. 450 lbs force.\nhttps://www.firgelliauto.com/products/super-duty-actuators\nThere are no limit switches.\nFeedback from Hall sensors.\n\nFuture addition? Firgelli makes a version with adjustable limit switches:\nhttps://www.firgelliauto.com/products/adjustable-stroke-linear-actuators?variant=39421954261063\nBut only up to 220 lbs force."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 90.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e830a07c-8ff3-448a-9441-d72d5eeafa05")
	)
